#   sudo systemctl daemon-reload && sudo systemctl enable --now bill-revalidate.timer
# Propose-only unless MODE=auto AND BILL_ALLOW_AUTO_EXEC=1 (the same double gate as every Bill ritual).
[Unit]
Description=Bill the Bull — open-position thesis re-validation (propose-only unless auto + opt-in)
